  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Whitaker Peace and Development Initiative (WPDI) - Lamwo Sunflower and Soybeans Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lamwo YPN farming and Ox traction group seeks to increase the quantity and quality of soybeans and sunflower farmed through increased capacity to farm on bigger land using ox-ploughs, improved seeds, good agronomic and post-harvest practices, increase access to working capital and technical services in Lamwo District, Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
